#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/prewitt.rst:47
msgid ""
"This effect/filter applies the Prewitt\\ [1]_ operator to the input video "
"stream. It detects edges (discrete differentiation operator) and, in the "
"default settings, colors them white and pinkish. Compare :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kirsch`, :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/roberts` and :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/sobel` effects."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter aplikuje Prewittov\\ [1]_ operátor na vstupný video tok. "
"Detekuje hrany (diskrétny diferenciačný operátor) a v predvolenom nastavení "
"ich farbí na bielo a ružovo. Porovnajte efekty :doc:`/effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/stylize/kirsch`, :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"stylize/roberts` a :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/sobel`."

